# STATION 13: media through the game's own systems: <<music>>, <<vfx>>, <<camera>>.
npc: @test_media
title: Station 13 - Music, effects, camera
speaker: Tester

== start
TEST 13: Media. Each option uses a game asset by id; the Asset Editor form and the node editor offer these ids as suggestions.
-> Play the Zone 0 playlist for me (expect the music to change within a few seconds)
    <<music MC_Zone0>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Back to the area's music (expect it to return to normal)
    <<music clear>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Particles at this NPC (expect a burst of Totem_Heal_Simple_Test at chest height)
    <<vfx Totem_Heal_Simple_Test>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Bigger, longer particles (expect the same effect at twice the size for 3 seconds)
    <<vfx Totem_Heal_Simple_Test 2 3>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Shake my camera (expect a short shake)
    <<camera Battleaxe_Bash>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Gentle shake (expect a much weaker one)
    <<camera Battleaxe_Bash 0.2>>
    <<jump start>>
-> Leave
    <<end>>
